{"3430600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fecal Freighter", "steam_appid": 3430600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden invasion of space aliens hunting for human biological waste, the job of a sewage truck operator has become a perilous craft. Join the elite of the elite and become a transporter of the brown gold — the very substance without which the world wouldn’t be quite so... picturesque. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/d9566175592ba890807223413e68aae5.poster.avif?t=1786345871\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/d9566175592ba890807223413e68aae5.webm?t=1786345871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/d9566175592ba890807223413e68aae5.mp4?t=1786345871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>But beware: dark alleys hide sinister surprises, and no matter how hard you try, you’ll never be fully prepared for what lurks there. It’s not just aliens after you — sludge demons spawned from the filth and the fanatical followers of the Brown Cult, whose ominous leader is rumored to have ties to a shadowy global government, are on your tail too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/f0d5c3f558825c9b8ea9def30c898391.poster.avif?t=1786345871\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/f0d5c3f558825c9b8ea9def30c898391.webm?t=1786345871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/f0d5c3f558825c9b8ea9def30c898391.mp4?t=1786345871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and upgrade your ZIL truck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in the stench-filled atmosphere of terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks for the district administrator and the sewage treatment plant director.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the open world, no matter how foul it smells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help locals dispose of hazardous waste and reduce environmental pollution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the aliens and expose the conspiracy of the secret global government.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💩 Welcome to the ride of your life — and what a smelly one it will be!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden invasion of space aliens hunting for human biological waste, the job of a sewage truck operator has become a perilous craft. Join the elite of the elite and become a transporter of the brown gold — the very substance without which the world wouldn’t be quite so... picturesque. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/d9566175592ba890807223413e68aae5.poster.avif?t=1786345871\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/d9566175592ba890807223413e68aae5.webm?t=1786345871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/d9566175592ba890807223413e68aae5.mp4?t=1786345871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>But beware: dark alleys hide sinister surprises, and no matter how hard you try, you’ll never be fully prepared for what lurks there. It’s not just aliens after you — sludge demons spawned from the filth and the fanatical followers of the Brown Cult, whose ominous leader is rumored to have ties to a shadowy global government, are on your tail too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/f0d5c3f558825c9b8ea9def30c898391.poster.avif?t=1786345871\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/f0d5c3f558825c9b8ea9def30c898391.webm?t=1786345871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/f0d5c3f558825c9b8ea9def30c898391.mp4?t=1786345871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and upgrade your ZIL truck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in the stench-filled atmosphere of terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks for the district administrator and the sewage treatment plant director.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the open world, no matter how foul it smells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help locals dispose of hazardous waste and reduce environmental pollution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the aliens and expose the conspiracy of the secret global government.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💩 Welcome to the ride of your life — and what a smelly one it will be!</p>", "short_description": "Become a sewage truck operator and survive the foul dangers: drive your ZIL, battle sludge demons, complete tasks, explore a grim world, and uncover the mystery of an alien conspiracy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_im